OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings continue for
OL,4,Aparts of UK with more rain expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FMet Office yellow warnings will remain
OL,7,Fin force for most of Thursday as heavy
OL,8,Frain and thunderstorms move northwards
OL,9,Facross the UK.
OL,11,FAn initial warning that covered
OL,12,Fsouth-east England for the early
OL,13,Fmorning has now expired, but another
OL,14,Fone covers a broader swathe of England
OL,15,Fand Wales and is valid until 22:00 BST.
OL,17,FDownpours will continue to bring the
OL,18,Frisk of flash flooding and travel
OL,19,Fdisruption.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
